      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In an attempt to facilitate access to pain relief treatments, the registered prescription sheets formerly used in France for the prescription of narcotics have been replaced by protected prescription forms complying with the technical specifications established by the AFNOR standards. When these new prescription forms were implemented, there was no modification in the legal regulations controlling narcotic supply to pharmacists."},
